  "description": "Winnovative Next Classic Compatibility Library for .NET lets an application written for the classic Winnovative HTML to PDF Converter for .NET (the Winnovative.HtmlToPdf package) run on the Winnovative PDF Next Library for .NET without code changes. The package keeps the classic Winnovative namespace and its public types (HtmlToPdfConverter, Document, PdfPage, the elements, templates, forms, bookmarks and security settings) and renders with the Chromium-based engine of Winnovative Next.\n\nReplace the classic package reference with this package and add the Winnovative Next HTML to PDF package of the platform the application runs on: Winnovative.Pdf.Next.HtmlToPdf.Windows, Winnovative.Pdf.Next.HtmlToPdf.Linux, Winnovative.Pdf.Next.HtmlToPdf.MacOS or the multi-platform metapackage Winnovative.Pdf.Next.HtmlToPdf. The license key is set as before.\n\nThe converters hand over the Winnovative Next converter before each conversion, for the options the classic API has no setting for, so the native API can be used alongside the classic one and the application can move to it gradually.\n\nCompatibility:\n\n* .NET 10.0, 9.0, 8.0, 7.0, 6.0 and .NET Standard 2.0\n* Windows, Linux and macOS\n* Web, Console and Desktop applications",
